{"title": "Elixir Table 2", "pageid": 14331, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elixir_Table_2", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Potion drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Elixir Table 2</b>, also known as <code>Alchemy_Potion_Elixir_2</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Alchemy_Potion_Elixir_2+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Alchemy_Potion_Elixir_2+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing strong <a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\">elixirs</a>. It is primarily used in the <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_Table\" title=\"Elixir Table\">Elixir Table</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drops\">Drops</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Battlemage%27s_Power\" title=\"Elixir of Battlemage's Power\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/ELX_Elixir_of_Battlemage%27s_Power_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Battlemage%27s_Power_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/ELX_Elixir_of_Battlemage%27s_Power_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Elixir_of_Battlemage%27s_Power_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/aa/ELX_Elixir_of_Battlemage%27s_Power_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/ELX_Elixir_